  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samusoni agwo Gasa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni akageenda Gasa, na aroro akarora omokungu omotayayi, akageenda akarara nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto ba Gasa baigwete ng’a Samusoni nao are, bagaetanana aase aria, bakamoboera ase egeita ki’omochie obotuko obogima. Bagakira‐kiri obotuko bwonsi, bagateeba, “Tiga toganye goika bokie mambia, erio tomoite.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Samusoni akarara goika botuko gati, erio akaimoka, akabwata ebisieri bibere bi’egeita ki’omochie amo nemetobwa yaye ebere; erio akabisimora amo nebioma na ebisiekero, akabibeeka ase amareko aye, akabiira igoro ase egetunwa keria kerochie Heburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samusoni na Delila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende magega y’ayio Samusoni akaba ogwancha omokungu ore korokwa Delila, omenyete ase ense omweya ya Soreki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abatang’ani b’Abafilisti bakageenda ase omokungu oria, bakamoteebia, “Gachie omoebererie Samusoni agoteebie obobisi bw’echinguru chiaye, naende buna toranyaare komobua; erio tonyaare komosiba na komobeeka inse ase tore. Kera oyomo ase tore nakoe chisekeli chi’echifeta elifu eyemo ne rigana erimo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Delila agateebia Samusoni, “Koranche, onteebie obobisi bw’echinguru chiao, naende onteebie buna omonto aranyare kogosiba akobue.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni akamoiraneria, “Kabaransibe ne chingori chi’emenyiki isan’aibere chinyia chitaroma, erio nainche nimbe omworo, na imbe buna monto onde bwensi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abatang’ani b’Abafilisti bakarentera omokungu oria chingori chi’emenyiki isan’aibere chinyia chitaroma, agasibera Samusoni nachirochio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria nabisete abanto baganyete ase akanyomba ka ime. Erio akamorangeria, “Samusoni! Abafirisiti aba bachire gokobwata!” Korende Samusoni akabutora chingori chiria buna eusi enyororo ekorurwa n’omorero. Ase ayio, obobisi bw’echinguru chiaye tibwamanyekanete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila agateebia Samusoni, “Rora, gwankoreire echeche, naende gwanteebirie oborimo. Koranche onteebie buna oranyaare gosibwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni akamoteebia, “Kobaransibe ne chingori chinyia chitarakorerwa emeremo, erio nimbe omworo, na imbe buna monto onde bwensi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Delila akaimokia chingori chinyia, akamosibera. Naende akamorangeria, “Samusoni! Abafirisiti aba bachire gokobwata!” Abanto nigo bebisete baganyete ase enyomba ende. Korende Samusoni akabutora chingori chiria korwa ase amaboko aye buna eusi enyororo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Delila agateebia Samusoni, “Goika bono gwankoreire echeche, na gonteebia oborimo. Nteebie buna oranyaare gosibwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samusoni akamoiraneria, “Korasiberanie ebikundo biria bitano na bibere bi’etukia yane ase egetambaa keria okoroisia na kobisiba bokong’u nekegobanio, tibikorusigwao, erio nimbe omworo, na imbe buna monto onde bwensi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekero Samusoni araarete, Delila akabwata ebikundo biria bitano na bibere bi’etukia yaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabisiberania ase egetambaa are koroisia, akabisiba bokong’u nekegobanio. Naende akamorangeria, “Samusoni! Abafirisiti aba bachire gokobwata!” Korende Samusoni akaboka, akang’usa etukia yaye korwa aase yasiberanetigwe na gokong’igwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria akamobooria, “Naki oranyaare goteeba ng’a nonyanchete, ekero enkoro yao etari amo nainche? Gwankoreire echeche chintunda isato na toranteebia obobisi bw’echinguru chiao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero omokungu oria arenge kona komoboora-booria amang’ana ayio rituko ase rituko, Samusoni akarosa kegima, goika akerusia moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo omoerio akamoteebia obobisi bwaye bwonsi, akabora, “Onde tana gokigita etukia y’omotwe one, ekiagera inche nigo naatananetwe ase Nyasae buna Omwerwa oye korwa ase enda ya baba. Inse gokigitwa etukia y’omotwe one, chinguru chiane nigo chirarue ase ’nde, naende imbe omworo, na imbe buna monto onde bwensi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Delila arooche ng’a Samusoni omoteebirie obobisi bwaye bwonsi, agatoma abanto barangerie abatang’ani b’Abafilisti, baabateebie, “Inchuo naende rimo, ekiagera ere onteebirie obobisi bwaye bwonsi.” Erio abatang’ani b’Abafilisti bagaacha ase omokungu oria, bakarentana chibeesa chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Delila akaareria Samusoni ase amagoro aye, akarangeria omonto ache agingire ebikundo biria bitano na bibere bi’etukia ya Samusoni. Erio Delila agachaaka komotura, korende chinguru chia Samusoni konya chiarure ase are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akarangeria, “Samusoni! Abafirisiti aba bachire gokobwata!” Samusoni akaboka korwa ase chitoro chiaye, akarengereria ng’a “Bono ninyesibore buna botambe, ’ngende,” ekiagera tamanyete ng’a Omonene omotigire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti bakamobwata, bakamokonora amaiso, naende bakamoira gochia Gasa, bakamosiba ne chingataare chie chitaai. Bakamobeeka gosia obosie agwo ase enyomba y’obosibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende etukia yaye egachaka komera naende magega gakigitirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa gwa Samusoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatang’ani b’Afilisti bagasangererekana koruera Dagoni, enyasae yabo, ekeng’wanso ekenene, na gochenga, bagoteeba, “Enyasae yaito yabeekire omobisa oito Samusoni ase amaboko aito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero abanto barooche Samusoni, bagatogia enyasae yabo, bagateeba, “Enyasae yaito yabeekire omobisa oito ase amaboko aito, omobisa oria osaririe ense yaito na oitire abanto baito abange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero chinkoro chiabo chiabeete n’omochengo, bagateeba, “Torentere Samusoni atokorere chigosori!” Ase ayio bakarenta Samusoni korwa enyomba y’obosibwa, ere akabakorera chigosori. Bakamobeeka agatenena gati‐gati ye chisiiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni agateebia omosae oria omobwatete okoboko kwaye, “Ntige ntaba‐tabe, nkune chisiiro chisiirete enyomba, inyesiirere ase chirochio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba nigo yaichire n’abanto, abasacha na abakungu, na abatang’ani bonsi b’Abafilisti nao barenge, na igoro ase ekerama mbarengeo abanto koreng’ana chilifu isato, abasacha na abakungu na barabwo nigo basonchete buna Samusoni agokora chigosori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Samusoni akarangeri’Omonene, akabora, “Omonene nagosabire ong’inyore, ong’e chinguru ase engaki eye yoka. Aye Nyasae, erio inyeruserie egesiomba ase amaiso ane abere igoro y’Abafilisti!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Samusoni akaboania chisiiro chiria ibere chia gati‐gati, chiasiirete enyomba, agachibwata bokong’u, esiiro eyemo n’okoboko okomo, na eyende n’okoboko konde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agateeba, “Tiga ’nkwe amo n’Abafilisti aba.” Naende agekumba ne chinguru chiaye chionsi, na enyomba eria ekagwera abatang’ani b’Abafilisti amo n’abanto bande bonsi abarengeo. Abanto baria Samusoni aitete ekero akwete omonyene nigo barenge abange kobua baria bonsi abaitete ekero arenge moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura bamwabo amo n’abanto bonsi b’eamate yaye bagatirimboka kwoyia omobere oye. Bakamoira, bakamotindeka ase egati ya Sora na Esitaoli, ase embeera ya Manoa ise. Samusoni konya ogambeire Abaisraeli ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
